<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Caixa Economica 1996 net 275.3 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Caixa Economica 1996 net 275.3 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's federally owned mortgage bank Caixa Economica Federal announced the following results for 1996.</p>
<p>			  1996				     1995</p>
<p>Net		   275.287 million reais	  221.313 million reais</p>
<p>Operating profit  115.199 million reais	  33.476 million reais loss</p>
<p>Note: The CEF attributed its improved performance in 1996 to higher levels of debt recovery and growth in deposits.</p>
<p>(( -- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
</text>
